    "end": 12.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "Not yet.",
   "zh": "还不能。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 12.5,
    "end": 14
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "I must water the garden first.",
   "zh": "我得先给花园浇水。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 14,
    "end": 17.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Susan",
   "en": "Do you have to water it now?",
   "zh": "你一定得现在浇吗？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 17.3,
    "end": 20.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "I'm afraid I must.",
   "zh": "恐怕我得现在浇。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 20.2,
    "end": 22.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "Look at it!",
   "zh": "你看看，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 22.5,
    "end": 23.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "It's terribly dry.",
   "zh": "干得厉害。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 23.7,
    "end": 26.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Susan",
   "en": "What a nuisance!",
   "zh": "真讨厌！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 26.3,
    "end": 28.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "Last summer it was very dry, too.",
   "zh": "去年夏天也是干得很。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 28.5,
    "end": 32.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "Don't you remember?",
   "zh": "你不记得了吗？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 32.1,
    "end": 33.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "I had to water it every day.",
   "zh": "我不得不每天浇水。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 33.7,
    "end": 37
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Susan",
   "en": "Well, I'll have tea by myself.",
   "zh": "好吧，我一个人喝茶了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 37,
    "end": 40.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Susan",
   "en": "That was quick!",
   "zh": "好快啊！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 40.9,
    "end": 42.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Susan",
   "en": "Have you finished already?",
   "zh": "你已经浇完了？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 42.8,
    "end": 44.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "Yes.",
   "zh": "是的。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 44.6,
    "end": 45.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "Look out of the window.",
   "zh": "你看看窗外。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 45.7,
    "end": 47.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Susan",
   "en": "It's raining!",
   "zh": "下雨了！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 47.8,
    "end": 49.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Susan",
   "en": "That means you don't need to water the garden.",
   "zh": "这就是说，你不必给花园浇水了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 49.8,
    "end": 53.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "That was a pleasant surprise.",
   "zh": "这是意想不到的好事。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L125.mp4",
    "start": 53.1,
    "end": 55.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Peter",
   "en": "It means I can have tea, instead.",
   "zh": "这意味着我反倒可以喝茶了。",
   "audio": {
